WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.000
In the public sector, indicators piled up faster than anyone retired them.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:07.500
Now I study why.

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.640
Dr Renke Sabel convenes the Indicator Commons,

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:14.550
Slop University's shared library of indicators.

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:16.660
Every measure needs a keeper,

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:18.630
and someone ready to take over.

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:22.690
A dog park's board, counting days since the last incident.

00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:25.020
A community hall's key register.

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:27.250
A lab's calibration weights.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:31.040
He holds more grants than anyone else at Slop University.

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:33.730
Four Indicator Stewardship grants.

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:35.888
Seven hundred and eighty-five thousand dollars.

00:00:36.188 --> 00:00:38.308
And one thousand and thirty-four citations.

00:00:39.308 --> 00:00:41.119
Starting to count is easy.

00:00:41.419 --> 00:00:43.579
I want to know who decides when to stop.

00:00:44.779 --> 00:00:46.539
Everything he's published is on our website.

00:00:46.689 --> 00:00:48.139
Say hello on Bluesky,

00:00:48.289 --> 00:00:49.159
or by email.
